My project: Consumer Price Index (CPI) Inflation Analysis using Excel.

I worked on a Consumer Price Index inflation analysis project using Microsoft Excel. The main objective was to understand how prices of different goods and services changed over time and analyse inflation trends in India. I started with raw CPI data containing monthly information for rural, urban and rural-plus-urban sectors. I prepared a separate cleaned-data sheet, used Pivot Tables to summarise CPI values, performed year-over-year and month-over-month analysis, and examined individual food categories. Additionally, I collected crude oil price data from the PPAC website and used the CORREL function to analyse its relationship with different CPI categories. Finally, I used these analyses to identify trends and understand how different categories behaved during the selected periods. Through this project, I improved my practical knowledge of Excel, Pivot Tables, percentage calculations and correlation analysis.
